sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as User
  participant FE as React Frontend
  participant API as Express API /api/generate
  participant LLM as Gemini
  participant V as Validator (Zod + repair)
  participant S3 as AWS S3
  participant DB as MongoDB Atlas

  U->>FE: Paste/upload brief and click Generate
  FE->>API: POST /api/generate with JWT and brief input
  API->>DB: Create/update proposal status = generating
  API->>LLM: Send prompt and start stream

  loop SSE stream while model is generating
    LLM-->>API: chunk
    API-->>FE: SSE chunk event
    FE-->>U: Progressive section rendering
  end

  API->>V: validateAndRepair(fullBuffer)
  V-->>API: Valid proposal JSON
  API->>S3: Save versioned proposal JSON in S3
  API->>DB: status=complete, versionCount++, metadata update
  API-->>FE: SSE complete event with proposalId and version
  FE-->>U: Proposal ready for review/export/chat refinement
